The only intentional divergence from the reference source is the PRIMES table
(keygen.c), regenerated at runtime from its definition rather than copied; all
other ported routines follow the reference's structure and arithmetic exactly.
The module's verification path and wire codecs are separately clean-room from
the Falcon specification — see the repository NOTICE (design references).
